            Initialize caches <math id="alg1.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{K}_{\mathrm{cache}},\mathbf{V}_{\mathrm{cache}},\mathbf{C}_{\mathrm{cache}},\mathbf{FFN\_OUT}_{\mathrm{cache}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐊</mi><mi>cache</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐕</mi><mi>cache</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐂</mi><mi>cache</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>𝐅𝐅𝐍</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐎𝐔𝐓</mi><mi>cache</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{K}_{\mathrm{cache}},\mathbf{V}_{\mathrm{cache}},\mathbf{C}_{\mathrm{cache}},\mathbf{FFN\_OUT}_{\mathrm{cache}}</annotation></semantics></math>

